{"parse":{"title":"Glory to Our Forebears","pageid":491545,"revid":2189658,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Glory to Our Forebears</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/70/Constellation_Glory_to_Our_Forebears.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031102\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Glory to Our Forebears\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/70/Constellation_Glory_to_Our_Forebears.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031102\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/70/Constellation_Glory_to_Our_Forebears.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031102 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/70/Constellation_Glory_to_Our_Forebears.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031102 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Glory to Our Forebears\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Glory_to_Our_Forebears.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Glory to Our Forebears.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Last_Offering\" title=\"Winter&#39;s Last Offering\">Winter's Last Offering</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Nobleborn%27s_Charge\" title=\"The Nobleborn&#39;s Charge\">The Nobleborn's Charge</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Ascension Talent <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Truth Prevails</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Truth Prevails</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Radiance: Stellar Swirl: Vesna will gain the corresponding effect based on the Elemental Type of her party members: <br /><ul><li>For every <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Cryo\" title=\"Cryo\">Cryo</a></b></span> or <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Anemo\" title=\"Anemo\">Anemo</a></b></span> character in her current party, Vesna's ATK increases by 6%; and</li><li>For every character of all other Elemental Types in her current party, Vesna's Elemental Mastery increases by 25 instead.</li></ul></span></span></span> is enhanced: Its ATK and Elemental Mastery bonuses increase to 3 times their original values.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Glory to Our Forebears</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_4_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 4 Constellation\">Level 4 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGlory_to_Our_Forebears%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Glor